## 🏃 Getting Started

### Backend (Scala)
1. Ensure Java 17+ is installed.
2. Run the compiled JAR:
   ```bash
   java --enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED -jar scala/spaceguard.jar 2026-01-01 2026-09-30
   ```

### Frontend (React)
1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```
2. Start the development server:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

